Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifth Episode\NThe Monsters of the Three Valleys\NValley of Monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.65,0:02:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the poisonous rose?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.26,0:02:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Because she was pricked by these thorns,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.29,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,my wife danced frantically for three days and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.25,0:02:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,three nights, and died just as you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.37,0:02:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But aren't there two coffins?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.43,0:02:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,One is my son's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.23,0:02:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,To cure the dance fever, there is only the Dance-Forgetting Herb from the Three Valleys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My son went to the Three Valleys to fetch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.87,0:02:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To the Three Valleys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They say there are three monsters there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.74,0:02:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.17,0:02:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He was chased back by a monster at the entrance of the First Valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.91,0:02:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and the wounds he received then have flared up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.74,0:03:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.93,0:03:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My, you must be careful with rose thorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.63,0:03:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My, a gift of roses every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.41,0:03:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I plan to keep this up until your birthday Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.15,0:03:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what color would be good for tomorrow morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.12,0:03:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A red rose would be lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.91,0:03:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.01,0:03:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My, what an energetic child.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Red roses tomorrow, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.05,0:04:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's pick a rose for Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.50,0:05:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, Prince Sapphire, touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.12,0:05:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Touch the thorn of the red rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you will...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.95,0:05:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.23,0:05:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to pick them this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Mylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.45,0:06:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My body is floating!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.00,0:06:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen was pricked by the thorn instead of the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fast-acting poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.47,0:06:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone, someone stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My body is floating!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it mean to be pricked by a poisoned rose?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.78,0:06:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of illness is it, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.86,0:06:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief. The target was missed, our expectations ruined—what a complete blunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.98,0:06:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She only has three days left?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.46,0:06:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How tragic!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.48,0:06:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Suffering from this fever, she may pass away by the third day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.19,0:06:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:06:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, what medicine will cure her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no choice but to apply the juice of the Dancing Forgetfulness Herb to the wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.06,0:07:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dancing Forgetfulness Herb?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.35,0:07:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it here at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, that blooms deep within the mountain valley;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.07,0:07:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,no one who has gone to retrieve it has ever returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.16,0:07:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The mountain valley?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.19,0:07:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the mountain valley where three monsters are said to live?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.57,0:07:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.27,0:07:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone, go and get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.98,0:07:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.71,0:07:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared of monsters?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No, actually, my wife is sick, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my wife is sick too...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,, I have a wife, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing but a bunch of weaklings!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I will go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.24,0:07:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.34,0:07:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse that Sapphire, let him go to the mountain valley and get eaten up by those three monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.14,0:07:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If something were to happen to your health, Your Highness...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.07,0:07:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who will go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, such resolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.97,0:08:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, even if it costs me my life, I will surely obtain that medicinal herb and return!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.82,0:08:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, good grief, young people these days are all good-for-nothings...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.34,0:08:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it, I'll go after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.91,0:08:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.05,0:08:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You say Her Majesty was pricked by a poisonous rose?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just sit around anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, watch over Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.28,0:08:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.07,0:08:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire went alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.24,0:08:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible news!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.13,0:08:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, dispatch the army immediately to go with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.55,0:08:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you choose the strongest ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, I chose only the weakest ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.67,0:09:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you the town florist?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.55,0:09:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I injured my leg and can no longer walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.47,0:09:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, were you done in by the monster of the First Valley...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my son was attacked, so I came all the way here to avenge him, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.37,0:09:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sigh, it's impossible with a leg like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.06,0:09:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I will avenge him for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.23,0:09:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you going to do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.90,0:10:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a legend saying that to defeat the monster of the First Valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you should fight with water rather than a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehehe, it's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.44,0:11:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good, it doesn't even flinch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.74,0:12:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.48,0:12:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.90,0:12:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.60,0:12:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.93,0:12:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,To defeat the monster of the First Valley, water works better than a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,When I splashed water on it, it started writhing in pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A bullet came out from inside its mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.94,0:13:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole day has already passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.03,0:13:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Two days left, and two monsters left as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.23,0:13:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.36,0:13:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take this with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll give me strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.18,0:13:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.42,0:13:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How tragic... You only have 2 days left to live...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange... It's suddenly gotten so cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.18,0:14:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What huge icicles...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.12,0:14:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for this fire, I'd surely die here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.86,0:14:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting sleepy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.76,0:14:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't fall asleep in a place like this... I still have to fight two more monsters...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.98,0:14:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this sleepiness...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,One and a half days left...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.23,0:15:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If Sapphire doesn't come back by tomorrow evening... Poor Queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.58,0:15:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire isn't coming back...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.37,0:15:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Sapphire is in the Second Valley by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.68,0:15:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Komadoriku, do you know the Third Valley?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you guide me there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.89,0:15:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.99,0:15:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already past noon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the monster of the Second Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.04,0:16:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.01,0:16:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.08,0:16:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.21,0:16:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.03,0:16:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trapped! I can't get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.81,0:16:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's my sword over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.93,0:16:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.04,0:17:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.19,0:17:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.76,0:17:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.35,0:17:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.34,0:17:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.60,0:17:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But the monster of the Third Valley is still left!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.16,0:17:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.32,0:17:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Washi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.22,0:17:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.97,0:17:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me to take this monster's ice fur?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.32,0:17:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Will taking the ice fur be useful?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.38,0:17:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.68,0:18:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.55,0:18:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.35,0:18:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's colder than ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Into this sword sheath...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.57,0:18:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Washi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.33,0:18:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Komadori-kun, are you guys coming along too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.94,0:18:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I wonder what kind of monster the beast of the Third Valley is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.78,0:19:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dead end!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is growing over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.28,0:19:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the Forget-to-Dance Herb!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.31,0:19:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pretty flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.09,0:19:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go around this way... that way's no good either!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.18,0:19:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, we have no choice but to cross this swamp, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.56,0:19:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get dragged into this swamp, you won't be able to get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.20,0:19:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.72,0:19:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.31,0:19:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to fetch it for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.25,0:19:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, little robins!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.94,0:19:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.50,0:19:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.97,0:20:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the monster of the Third Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.49,0:20:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.68,0:20:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.34,0:20:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's growing right over there, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.66,0:20:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.66,0:20:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.01,0:20:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.49,0:20:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Give back Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:20:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.11,0:21:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.30,0:21:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's icy fur!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.40,0:21:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please save us somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.80,0:21:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It froze!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.00,0:21:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It froze!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster has frozen solid!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.44,0:21:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.35,0:21:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry and take those flowers back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.17,0:21:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is more than enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.80,0:21:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.42,0:21:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.37,0:21:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the third day!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get back before the sun sets!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't make it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.38,0:22:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.68,0:22:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.22,0:22:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have Komodori-kun carry it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.30,0:22:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.27,0:22:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll squeeze the grass juice and you take it with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.83,0:22:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Apply this to the wound on the Queen's finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.18,0:22:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.18,0:22:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.14,0:22:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.69,0:22:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh God!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.62,0:22:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh God!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.31,0:23:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the matter, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.25,0:23:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.45,0:23:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.03,0:23:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's certainly a disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.92,0:23:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.62,0:23:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait... does that mean Sapphire managed to get the medicinal herbs safely... Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.20,0:23:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.02,0:23:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.19,0:23:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.18,0:23:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Nylon went mad with joy because the Queen came back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.24,0:24:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you make it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.53,0:24:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.22,0:24:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
